<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman upgrades SocGen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman upgrades SocGen.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Feb 10 (REUTER) - French banking group Societe Generale was raised to &quot;market outperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
